OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FOfficers restrained and arrested Both
OL,7,FDouk Deng outside a school after he
OL,8,Fwas spotted by members of staff
OL,9,Fholding weapons and a canister of
OL,10,Fpetrol.
OL,12,FBody-cam shows the moment police
OL,13,Farrested an "attention seeking" failed
OL,14,Fasylum seeker, who went to a school
OL,15,Farmed with a hammer, a hatchet and a
OL,16,Fkitchen knife.
OL,26,@uD@MOUuD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
