OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FBoth Douk Deng, a South Sudanese
OL,7,Fnational, became "increasingly
OL,8,Ffrustrated" that immigration
OL,9,Fauthorities were not providing
OL,10,Fassistance in his bid to stay and work
OL,11,Fin the UK.
OL,13,FThe 21-year-old, who has applied for
OL,14,Fand been refused asylum three times,
OL,15,Fwanted to "create a scene for
OL,16,Fattention" to aid his cause,
OL,17,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court
OL,18,Fheard.
OL,26,@oD@ROUpD@KO]wD@KOUxD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FHe was arrested after workmen
OL,7,Fconfronted him on the premises of
OL,8,FEdgar Wood Academy in Heywood,
OL,9,FGreater, Manchester, on 6 August 2025.
OL,11,FA member of the public earlier raised
OL,12,Fthe alarm after he was observed
OL,13,F"behaving oddly" in the street nearby
OL,14,Fen route to the secondary school
OL,15,Fholding a petrol can with a hammer
OL,16,Ftied to his belt.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FDeng was "mumbling" as he walked a
OL,7,F"full circuit" around the school,
OL,8,Fwhich was closed to pupils for the
OL,9,Fsummer, as he scanned the building and
OL,10,Fthen approached it before builders
OL,11,Fworking on site became concerned and
OL,12,Fcalled the police.
OL,14,FThe defendant was walking away from
OL,15,Fthe premises when he was detained, the
OL,16,Fcourt was told.
OL,18,FAlong with the hammer and hatchet, he
OL,19,Fwas found to be in possession of a
OL,20,Fseven-inch kitchen knife and half a
OL,21,Flitre of petrol.
OL,26,@nD@JOUnD@SO]oD@AOUoD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FA day earlier he was spotted "acting
OL,7,Foddly" at another school, Holy Family
OL,8,FRC and CE College in Rochdale, also
OL,9,Fclosed to pupils, where he kicked and
OL,10,Fdamaged its intercom.
OL,12,FSara Haque, defending, said: "He
OL,13,Fmaintains that his actions were not
OL,14,Fmotivated by any desire to injury or
OL,15,Fharm any person.
OL,17,F"This was a bizarre and compulsive act
OL,18,Flacking in any type of maturity at a
OL,19,Ftime when he was in deep distress
OL,20,Fhaving left Sudan and his family in
OL,21,Ftraumatic circumstances.
OL,26,@nD@^OUoD@FO]tD@^OUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,F"He wanted attention and he was in
OL,7,Fcrisis but he was not motivated by
OL,8,Fhostility towards children, teachers
OL,9,For the wider public. There is no
OL,10,Fevidence that he threatened any
OL,11,Findividual."
OL,13,FDeng, who has a wife and children, was
OL,14,Fplaced in multiple accommodation
OL,15,Fhousing (HMO) on his arrival in the
OL,16,FUK, the court was told.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FMs Haque said: "He found himself in a
OL,7,Fforeign country with very limited
OL,8,FEnglish and unable to work because of
OL,9,Fhis immigration status. He believed
OL,10,Fand felt no-one was listening to him
OL,11,Fand no-one was helping him.
OL,13,F"He felt he had reached the of his
OL,14,Fability to cope within the HMO where
OL,15,Fothers in similar circumstances to him
OL,16,Fhad been assisted by the immigration
OL,17,Fauthorities.
OL,26,@nD@POUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,F"He became increasingly frustrated
OL,7,Fthat the same was not happening for
OL,8,Fhim. His only wish is to work and find
OL,9,Fmoney to support his family."
OL,11,FPsychiatric reports on the defendant
OL,12,Fhad not identified any major mental
OL,13,Fhealth issues, the court heard.
OL,15,FDeng, of Heywood, pleaded guilty at an
OL,16,Fearlier hearing to a range of offences
OL,17,Fincluding criminal damage and
OL,18,Fpossessing weapons and a knife in a
OL,19,Fpublic place and on school premises.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785496710
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FHe was jailed for two years, and told
OL,7,Fhe must serve up to half his sentence
OL,8,Fin custody and the remainder on
OL,9,Flicence.
OL,11,FJudge Bernadette Baxter told him: "I
OL,12,Fhave no power to order the Home Office
OL,13,Fto do anything.
OL,15,F"But in my judgment, given your
OL,16,Fcircumstances as a failed asylum
OL,17,Fseeker who has been in custody for the
OL,18,Fbest part of a year, the Home Office
OL,19,Fshould be doing something rather than
OL,20,Fnothing to deal with your status in
OL,21,Fthis country."
OL,26,@sD@cOUwD@AOU}D@NO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
